\addvspace {10\p@ }
\addvspace {10\p@ }
\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2.1}{\ignorespaces Positioning of K-Bound against adjacent methods. Prior TTA methods adapt (some with internal guards); performance estimators operate post-hoc. No prior method provides a single pre-adaptation adapt/freeze/abstain certificate with an explicit, proven unknowable region and a false-adapt bound. \textsc {KGA}\ wraps any TTA candidate without modifying it.}}{17}{table.2.1}%
